WEBVTT

00:00:00.602 --> 00:00:02.337
tsvishn di yidn?

00:00:02.337 --> 00:00:05.996
in vu ir hot, in di plats, in di shtetl vu ir hot gevoynt,

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:08.983
hot ir gehat oykh farbindung mit di goyim dortn?

00:00:11.892 --> 00:00:13.641
ir farshteyt nisht vos ikh freg?

00:00:11.925 --> 00:00:16.661
neyn, ikh farshtey nisht di frage. dos iz tsvey fragns vos ir hot gefregt.

00:00:14.203 --> 00:00:18.874
ir f- neyn, ikh hob gezogt az ir hot dertseylt

00:00:18.874 --> 00:00:32.810
az mit di yidn hot men hot men gehat shtar- shtark in kontakt. m'hot geholfn m'hot ge- a mentsh vos hot nisht gehat oyf shabes, hot ir, dos hot ir getsolt. yo. vos far a farbindung hot ir gehat mit di goyim in di shtetl?

00:00:22.658 --> 00:00:28.710
yo yo. yo, dos nisht ge- dos hot nisht ekzistirt.

00:00:34.352 --> 00:00:39.931
s'iz do deriber a sakh tsu tseyln, dos iz di bafelkerung, di OCHLUSIYA, azoy vi m'zogt es oyf ivrit,

00:00:39.516 --> 00:00:40.421
yo.

00:00:39.988 --> 00:00:43.824
iz geven zeyer gemisht, un d'geven Estraykh iz geven a sakh daytshn,

00:00:43.824 --> 00:00:45.655
un ungarn zenen geven a sakh.

00:00:45.655 --> 00:00:50.462
geven sektn, rusishe SHVATIM, vos zey hobn geheysn lipoverner.

00:00:51.936 --> 00:00:56.734
un un UNK. iz undz ze'mir geven, undz ho'mir gevoynt di yidn

00:00:56.734 --> 00:01:01.273
bederekh klal in tsentrum. di yidn zenen geven di raykhe, di bafelkerung iz geven

00:01:01.273 --> 00:01:04.181
zeyer veynik raykhe. di bafelkerung iz geven zeyer orem.

00:01:05.942 --> 00:01:08.740
ober undz ho'mir gehat shkheynim daytsher.

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:12.500
undz hobn gehat shkheynim rumenisher. ungarn.

00:01:14.143 --> 00:01:17.489
dos heyst azoy ar- arum undz nisht vayt fun UNK.

00:01:17.489 --> 00:01:23.789
ey- eyn daytshike iz gekumen voynen in zibete hoyz fun undz, yene hobn shoyn geheysn di raykhe.

00:01:24.235 --> 00:01:26.794
di vos hobn gehat groyse postns, mit,

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:32.970
undz ho'mir dayke ho'mir undz zeyer gut gelebt. gu- gut gelebt, zol nokh nisht meynen epes mir ho'mir gut gelebt, nor

00:01:32.993 --> 00:01:38.488
farn krig iz es geven ⟨farheltns⟩ gut morgn, bay undz iz geven di heflekhkeyt zeyer groys.

00:01:38.595 --> 00:01:46.014
un der der goy iz derkh, hot er gut morgn FRAU Frid, vi GEHTS, mir ho'mir ale gemuzt entfern, ven nisht hot men yo.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:48.882
un di zelbe ho'mir undz bagr- gemuzt bagrisn di

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:52.056
di goyishe shokhnte, meshum darkey sholem.

00:01:52.635 --> 00:01:56.426
ober vos iz geven, az m'hot gehat tsum bayshpil a SICHSUCH mitn

00:01:56.449 --> 00:02:00.411
rumenishn shokhn, iz geven biter azoy.

00:02:00.411 --> 00:02:04.019
m'hot tomer iz er geven shiker iz er geshprungen mitn meser punkt azoy vi der araber.

00:02:04.532 --> 00:02:08.761
m'hot azoy moyre gehat tsu tshepen mit a goy a shokhn, iber a kleynikeyt.

00:02:08.785 --> 00:02:13.886
ikh veys, a kind hot opgerisn a blum fun zayn gortn ober nisht velndik, oder arayn getantst, hot er

00:02:13.886 --> 00:02:23.241
oysgetretet di betn fun di royzn, hot er a tret getun, iz shoyn geven UNK, geshrign royzn un m'hot di kinder hobn a teyl gemakht dos kind gekumen koyle-koyles tsu der mame

00:02:23.365 --> 00:02:26.076
vos di mame hot zikh opgebetn, s'a kind, zi hot nisht oygepa-

00:02:26.571 --> 00:02:32.792
tomer oder bay der man gehat epes mit dem tate, ikh veys vos, UNK undzer arbet, hot men gehat alerley.

00:02:32.899 --> 00:02:38.844
iz a mol, ikh veys, iz oysgekumen er hot nisht gut gemakht di arbet, oder er hot nisht gemakht vifl er hot gedarft, tsi er

00:02:38.844 --> 00:02:44.033
tsi un s'kumt a mol, vi azoy men arbet kumt a SICHSUCH,

00:02:44.033 --> 00:02:47.287
hot er gekent in a por minut hot er gekent tsushpringen mitn meser.

00:02:47.985 --> 00:02:50.459
dos iz geven der rumener. un der unger nokh arger.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:55.776
di unger zenen geven di zey hobn gehat, zey flegn HOVALA azoy mit di veglekh, azoy kutshers, mit yo.

00:02:55.950 --> 00:03:00.166
mit di iz es geven shreklekh. m'hot azoy zikh gehit tsu tshepen mit a goy azoy.

00:03:00.166 --> 00:03:01.347
di rumener unger.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:04.129
der daytsh, funem daytsh hot men nisht moyre gehat.

00:03:04.523 --> 00:03:07.110
mit a daytsh hot men heflekh geredt, der

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:11.486
der daytsh iz nisht geven a tipesh aza groyzamer vi dos andere, derfar

00:03:11.593 --> 00:03:17.496
iz di zog ikh, baton ikh alts, iz di SHOAH iz a ibernatirlekhe zakh.

00:03:17.496 --> 00:03:21.442
vayl ver s'hot gekent dos daytshe folk iz geven a shtark, a sakh daytshe bafelkerung.

00:03:22.157 --> 00:03:24.631
ikh hob gehat daytshe kolegen in in shul.

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:28.496
az az fun azolkhe inteligente, ruike

00:03:28.806 --> 00:03:37.878
un heflekhe mentshn hobn gekent vern, zogn antisemitn, zenen di ale g-, ho'mir gevust az yedn goy iz antisem- ober vern azolkhe khayes roes,

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:42.210
zogt men hot men keyn mol nisht geven gegloybt. nisht nor ikh, nor a sakh.

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:43.701
un dos iz,

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:46.468
ven hot ir gezen az s- s'kumt a shlekhte tsayt yetst?

00:03:46.288 --> 00:03:48.529
yare nayn un draysik beerekh.

00:03:48.415 --> 00:03:50.468
biz damolts niks?

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:53.285
biz damolts hot men nisht hot men nisht gefilt keyn keyn,

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:54.855
vi hot ir dos gefilt, vi hot ir dos gehert?

00:03:54.102 --> 00:04:00.064
yo, vi azoy m'hot es gefilt? koydem tsu tsu ersht iz geven tsugemakht di shuln.

00:04:00.064 --> 00:04:05.489
aroysgetribn di yidishe shilerins fun di shul. UNK iz geven a tsores, m'lozt nisht

00:04:05.489 --> 00:04:07.978
shtudirn. undz ho'mir zikh nisht azoy shtark gebenkt, men,

00:04:07.978 --> 00:04:11.527
nor s'gekumen a erniderung. a arapzetsung funem yid.

00:04:11.719 --> 00:04:13.766
m'hot ongehoybn tsu bavarfn mit shteyner.

00:04:13.766 --> 00:04:15.595
gekent zitsn shabes baym tish,

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:20.862
plutsling iz arayn a a UNK, oysgezetst ale shoybn.

00:04:20.862 --> 00:04:22.414
dos iz geven bay undz in shtub,

00:04:22.414 --> 00:04:27.879
az ikh bin demolts lebn, un di politsey iz gekumen, politsey vos hot nisht tsugelozt, ober vern nokh dem vayl m'hot nisht undz ge-

00:04:27.902 --> 00:04:33.076
baklopt, flegn zey, zey zenen oykh geven antisemitn. flegn lozn di di huliganes getun vos zey hobn gevolt.

00:04:32.914 --> 00:04:37.565
un ir gedenkt ver hot dos gemakht? di rumenish, di ungarish? di rumener.

00:04:33.083 --> 00:04:34.123
un derno-

00:04:35.698 --> 00:04:38.954
di rumener. di rumener. vayl di daytshn,

00:04:38.954 --> 00:04:42.715
vi azoy der daytsh hot, Rumenyen hot zikh gefreyt ven m'hot untergegebn,

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:47.306
hot er aroysgenumen di daytshe bafelkerung keyn Doytshland,

00:04:47.663 --> 00:04:53.414
un UNK groyse plakatn, Doytshland get heym.

00:04:53.414 --> 00:05:01.699
zey hobn ibergegebn, di rumenishe regirung hot zey batsolt far zeyere dires un zey hobn bakumen in Doytshland. dos heyst Bukhnland get heym. dos heyst di bukeviner gebt

00:05:01.699 --> 00:05:05.410
gehert tsurik, hot men ale daytshn aroysgenumen.

00:05:05.618 --> 00:05:14.010
un dortn hot men gebrakht di rumener mit alerley, vos ir vilt antisemitn mit goyim, vos iz ales geven oyf di pleytse fun yidn.

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:15.031
azoy vi di yidn sh-

00:05:15.031 --> 00:05:20.195
un nokh nokh vos s'geven, undz hobn geshp- m'hot s'nisht gekumen mit a mol.

00:05:20.195 --> 00:05:24.292
tsum bayshpil in a in a shabes iz gekumen ikh gedenk nisht velkher rebe.

00:05:24.349 --> 00:05:27.870
un mayn tate iz gegangen tsun a zits fraytik tsu nakhts.

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:30.738
m'hot m'iz nokh nisht geven azoy gevornt.

00:05:30.846 --> 00:05:36.493
un di di barn hobn zikh bafaln, a a grupe yidn iz aheymgegangen shabes bay nakht nokhn tish,

00:05:37.343 --> 00:05:43.277
hobn bafaln di yidn, m'hot zey ongehoybn tsu shlogn. hobn zey gehat azolkhe shtekenes ir zet azoy vi do un do a kugl,

00:05:43.435 --> 00:05:48.460
un in dem kugl iz geven arayngeshtekt negl ober farkert, ir farshteyt, di shpits funem nogl iz geven gor,

00:05:47.097 --> 00:05:48.593
nogl UNK.

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:50.212
un der tate olev-asholem hot gekhapt,

00:05:50.337 --> 00:05:53.455
un m'hot ongehoybn tsu loyfn, zenen zey im nokhgelofn, hobn zey im derlangt

00:05:53.455 --> 00:05:55.632
in hartn fleysh funem fus.

00:05:55.632 --> 00:06:01.707
yorn hot er gelitn tomer s'hot zikh oysgeheylt, di di negl zenen arayn a a mazldik s'iz geven oyf a plats

00:06:01.707 --> 00:06:03.864
ir veyst oyfn UNK.

00:06:04.157 --> 00:06:08.538
azoy hot men zikh shoyn ongehoybn tsu hitn. nokh hot men ofitsyel geshlosn di shul.

00:06:09.118 --> 00:06:11.537
ofitsyel nisht gelozt geyn davenen.

00:06:11.312 --> 00:06:12.875
gedenkt ir ven?

00:06:11.537 --> 00:06:15.880
un nokh hot geven nokh shtarkere tsores. plutsem hot ongehoybn

00:06:15.919 --> 00:06:20.857
dos iz shoyn geven mitn bafel funem daytsh, hot shoyn ongehoybn der oysrotung der JUDEN.

00:06:21.032 --> 00:06:28.260
farshidene antisemitishe plakatn. m'hot dem kenig aropgevorfn, dos iz geven dos ershte. vi lang der kenig der kenig Karl iz geven oyf der melukhe,

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:33.027
hot men keyn yidish nisht azoy, s'demolts iz geven nor UNK. dos ershte hobn zey im aropgevorfn dem kenig,

00:06:33.027 --> 00:06:37.035
un s'gevorn a groyse anarkhi, ir farshteyt, yeder hot getun vos er hot gevolt.

00:06:37.035 --> 00:06:42.710
un ver s'hot gehat a a khrap oyf a a SICHSUCH mit a shokhn, hot zikh gehaltn MISHPAT aleyn.

00:06:42.818 --> 00:06:45.396
s'geven zeyer zeyer biter un zoyer.

00:06:45.396 --> 00:06:51.488
azoy hot es langzam ongehoybn. un s'geven tsaytn vos s'hot zikh geshtilt, zey hobn es genumen mer in der hant s'zol nisht vern aza min,

00:06:51.488 --> 00:06:56.695
vayl zey aleyn flegn zikh raysn bay di kep, ver s'zol mer rabeven un ver nemen. hobn zey oykh gehat tsores.

00:06:56.695 --> 00:06:58.711
azoy az m'hot gemuzt a bisl ordenung makhn.

00:06:58.711 --> 00:07:03.365
nokh hobn zikh vos a mol ongehoybn di shtarke tsores ofitsyel.

00:07:03.388 --> 00:07:05.190
oysgegangen ofntlekh,

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:11.516
s'kumt a UNK der lebn zoln zey UNK, yidishn folk borekh-hashem iz geblibn lebn, oysrotung der JUDEN.

00:07:11.927 --> 00:07:15.346
un oyf rumenish, ir vet dos nisht farshteyn, farshidene

00:07:16.412 --> 00:07:19.717
oyf di vent oyfgeshribn mit haknkreytsn mit,

00:07:20.517 --> 00:07:23.770
plutsem in a nakht iz nelm gevorn der rov,

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:26.234
der advokat, der roshekool,

00:07:26.234 --> 00:07:29.482
nisht ge- nelm gevorn iz nelm gevorn. m'hot gekhapt, ayngezetst in tfise.

00:07:29.482 --> 00:07:34.764
nokh a por, nokh a kerts shtikl tsayt hot men ongehoybn tsum sof, farnikhtung.

00:07:34.764 --> 00:07:36.507
nemt m'hot genumen azoy di UNK,

00:07:36.565 --> 00:07:40.946
m'hot z- m'hot zey ershosn oyser der shtot in a masn-grub.

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:43.092
nokh dem s'gevorn a shre-

00:07:41.948 --> 00:07:43.376
velkhe plats?

00:07:43.092 --> 00:07:48.017
in velkhn plats? vu ver vu? yo, lebn di, al-pi-rov lebn di bate-kvores.

00:07:49.542 --> 00:07:53.434
nokh dem s'gevorn ongehoybn tsu vern a shtarke panik in der shtot.

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:59.137
az a a bay undz flegn zayn a sakh tshares, ir veyst vos heyst tshares, di shvartse feygl, vi azoy heysn zey oyf ivrit?

00:08:00.338 --> 00:08:03.089
OR- OR- OR- OR- ORVIM iz geven a sakh.

00:08:01.101 --> 00:08:03.120
ORVIM ORVIM.

00:08:03.089 --> 00:08:08.385
s'geven a gantse bay di politsey vos zey hobn gemegt trogn vafn, NESHEK,

00:08:08.458 --> 00:08:13.227
tsu lernen zikh LIKLOA EL HAMATARA s'iz a di feyglekh zenen gezesn oyfn

00:08:13.453 --> 00:08:16.619
oyfn CHASHMAL dortn, aroptsushisn feygl.

00:08:16.963 --> 00:08:21.626
un dos iz m'hot shoyn gevust, s'hot zikh nisht dershrokn. ober nokh dem vos s'gevorn aza min panik un m'hot gehert

00:08:21.626 --> 00:08:24.618
a koyl shisn, afile nor fun aza dos fun a,

00:08:24.945 --> 00:08:29.844
iz ale yidn m'hot zikh bahaltn in di in in di in di shtiber, m'iz nisht aroysgega-

00:08:29.844 --> 00:08:34.831
ir hot gefilt di moyre, ir hot zi gekent onkhapn mit di hent. aza min panik.

00:08:34.831 --> 00:08:39.986
az ikh bin gekumen keyn Erets-Yisroel, gehert hobn mir, fray oder vos UNK hobn zikh arumgeringlt UNK.

00:08:39.986 --> 00:08:45.209
ikh bin gekumen shpet, do iz shoyn geven shtil. mikh ongehoybn mir dertseyln, rumenisher, vi azoy s'iz haynt in Rumenye,

00:08:45.209 --> 00:08:50.111
hob ikh a bisl gevolt dertseyln, hob ikh koydem azoy mikh gut umgekukt tsi UNK tsi s'hert mikh nisht,

00:08:50.111 --> 00:08:53.596
hot zikh eyner zeyer tselakht, vos hot gefilt vos ikh tu, zogt zi bist do in Erets-Yisroel,

00:08:53.596 --> 00:08:59.212
do megstu afile oyfn ROSH-MEMSHALA redn, s'vet dir keyner gornisht ton. zi hot gefilt vos ikh tu.

00:08:59.235 --> 00:09:02.317
azoy, neyn, azoy iz dos nokhgelofn der pakhed.

00:09:04.045 --> 00:09:07.313
un dernokh hot ongehoybn mit undz aroystraybn.

00:09:07.555 --> 00:09:09.990
ofitsyel m'zol zikh tsugreytn,

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.709
ven iz dos gevezn?

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:16.357
in yere eyn un fertsik. dos tsvey yor iz geven unruen azolkhe vos undz hobn gelebt in shreklekhn pakhed, far,

00:09:15.267 --> 00:09:20.475
vos hobn gemakht di kinder vos hobn nisht gelernt, di bokherim, in der heym.

00:09:18.237 --> 00:09:20.731
zenen gezesn in der heym, vos zey hobn getun, yo.

00:09:20.731 --> 00:09:24.626
ikh zog dokh aykh, dos vos hot mir dertseylt fun Beys Yankev, vi azoy m'hot geshlosn di Beys Yankev shul,

00:09:24.835 --> 00:09:28.643
iz a shtikl tsayt, nisht keyn sakh, s'hot nisht oysgehaltn, di lererin hot gemuzt aheymforn.

00:09:29.307 --> 00:09:34.341
flegn mir yedes mol bayn an anderer in shtub lernen, un eyne iz geshtanen SHMIRA.

00:09:34.341 --> 00:09:37.243
gemakht dem simen tomer iz emetser CHASHUD,

00:09:37.243 --> 00:09:39.392
hot men geleygt oyf UNK di hefter,

00:09:39.465 --> 00:09:46.347
un m'iz zikh gegangen shpiln, hot z- m'iz aribergeshprungen a ployt un m'iz avek. dos hot gedoyert a kertse, s'hot nisht oysgehaltn dos oykh nisht.

00:09:46.347 --> 00:09:47.845
m'hot dos oykh nisht gekent.

00:09:48.325 --> 00:09:51.407
nokh fleg men onheybn tsu raysn bay di peyes.

00:09:51.902 --> 00:09:53.814
yo.

00:09:51.987 --> 00:09:53.449
raysn bay di peyes?

00:09:53.814 --> 00:09:56.148
nokh dem s'gekumen a gezets optsushern di berd.

00:09:57.235 --> 00:09:59.996
oy dos iz geven a bitere gere- gzeyre!

00:10:01.082 --> 00:10:05.694
a klal mayn tate borekh-hashem hot oysgefirt, m'hot im m'hot zikh nisht gelozt opshern di bord.

00:10:05.694 --> 00:10:10.242
eyner hot zikh fleg fleg zikh ontun a shal, er hot tseyn vey, UNK, yo.

00:10:10.242 --> 00:10:13.642
argste vos iz geven, noent farn evakuirn,

00:10:13.642 --> 00:10:16.617
di mener hobn nisht getort shlofn in der heym. s'geven

00:10:16.692 --> 00:10:18.711
a gemakht azoy vi a geto,

00:10:18.733 --> 00:10:23.486
dortn yede mol oyf der nakht hobn gemuzt ahinkumen di mener. ikh veys nisht fun akhtsn yor tsi fun vifl.

00:10:23.543 --> 00:10:27.413
shloft dortn biz in der fri, nokh dem hobn zey gemegt aheymgeyn, m'zol zey hobn

00:10:27.413 --> 00:10:28.836
m'zol zey hobn in di hent.

00:10:30.023 --> 00:10:38.808
un dernokh fleg zayn oyf epes UNK yo, dernokh hot zikh ongehoybn der krig Rusland mit Daytshland.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:43.637
iz Rumenye hot dokh nisht gekemft, nor der daytsh.

00:10:43.637 --> 00:10:47.094
nor di rusishe, nor vayl s'iz geven a daytshe,

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:51.296
s'hot gehert tsum daytsh, flegn di rusn, zenen geven di ershte AVIRONIM

00:10:51.488 --> 00:10:55.768
vos zenen gegangen hobn n- nokh in Ridevits ho'mir gekhapt a bombe dermint.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.789
vos heyst, in mitn heln tog.

00:10:59.453 --> 00:11:02.985
azoy vi di feygl, hert di rusn. rusn.

00:11:02.985 --> 00:11:04.678
zey hobn zikh aropgelozt niderik,

00:11:05.123 --> 00:11:14.904
m'hot gezen afile dem roytn shtern. un afile nisht mit keyn bombn, zondern mit mit ralerer, vos heyst ralerer, s'iz a gever azoy vi a katushye mit, s'shist aroys mit a mil a sakh

00:11:15.147 --> 00:11:18.803
a sakh kuglen. a vi azoy heyst oyfn ivrit? s'hot a nomen.

00:11:15.332 --> 00:11:16.355
koyln.

00:11:18.808 --> 00:11:21.657
maystns hot es geheysn mit- yo, TROROT, yo.

00:11:18.927 --> 00:11:21.722
FROROT. FROROT.

00:11:21.657 --> 00:11:25.299
hobn zikh azoy az makhn a GICHA, un araynlozn in a hoyf,

00:11:25.558 --> 00:11:28.567
un azoy az zey viln mit a zikher shis.

00:11:28.567 --> 00:11:31.290
ir hert. der dakh undzerer iz geven tselekhert.

00:11:31.448 --> 00:11:34.159
dos roy-materyal undzers iz geven zeyer,

00:11:34.266 --> 00:11:36.656
s'hot zikh gikh ongetsundn, vi azoy heyst,

00:11:36.612 --> 00:11:37.703
DALIK.

00:11:36.696 --> 00:11:37.719
DALIK.

00:11:37.995 --> 00:11:39.845
hot oysgebrokhn a sreyfe.

00:11:40.729 --> 00:11:45.358
un m'hot ongehoybn, s'geven, un di behole un di panik, ver s'ken, dos ken men nisht farshteyn.

00:11:45.358 --> 00:11:49.652
dos iz geven di rusishe AVIRONIM. di rusishe AVIRONIM zenen geven kleyne, azoy vi feyglekh.

00:11:49.652 --> 00:11:52.214
zey hobn oykh gehat kalye makhn, UNK.

00:11:53.166 --> 00:11:57.483
shvere bombardimentn vos hobn mitgemakht in Rusland iz fun di daytshn.

00:11:57.483 --> 00:12:00.231
der daytsher MAFTSITS,

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:05.945
khuts vos er hot MAFTSITS geven, hot geven aza min meshune kol, koydem iz er geven groys un shver,

00:12:05.945 --> 00:12:14.915
un ven der kol zayne iz geven azoy vi khayes toyref, azoy vi zey zenen geven. fun der vaytns, ir hert, zenen shoyn geven mumkhim, az dos iz daytshe AVIRONIM,

00:12:14.915 --> 00:12:16.431
un dos iz rusishe, di

00:12:16.707 --> 00:12:20.306
oybn iz geven luft-kamfn. vi azoy zogt men, KRAV AVIRI.

00:12:19.288 --> 00:12:20.446
KRAVOT AVIR.

00:12:20.306 --> 00:12:20.920
KEN.

00:12:21.718 --> 00:12:24.702
lemayse dos iz shoyn, dos tseyl ikh shoyn ven undz ze'mir geven in lager,

00:12:24.702 --> 00:12:27.267
ven m'hot undz ariber getribn dem Dnyester, ven m'hot undz shoyn farshikt,

00:12:27.267 --> 00:12:30.622
iz ze'mir undz geven, di front iz forgega-

00:12:30.662 --> 00:12:33.806
un undz hot men alts geshikt untern untern front.

00:12:33.244 --> 00:12:33.913
front.

00:12:33.806 --> 00:12:40.747
di MATARA iz geven undz farnikhtn. ofn gezogt, undz zo'mir faln fun di bomben, farhungern, un fun masn-greber, vifl zey hobn gekent fun undz dershisn.

00:12:40.939 --> 00:12:44.766
khuts mize iz di shverste geven undz fleg'mir zayn SHETACH-hefker.

00:12:44.766 --> 00:12:49.095
di tomed ze'mir geven tsvishn di KRAVOT. biz der eybershter hot geholfn

00:12:49.095 --> 00:12:53.099
az der rus iz arayn tif, der der daytsh iz arayn tif in Rusland,

00:12:53.443 --> 00:12:55.541
un er hot zikh fartsoygn biz MOSCOW,

00:12:55.541 --> 00:12:59.242
un undz ze'mir geblibn lebn Dnyester, ho'mir dos anderthalbn sho

00:12:59.839 --> 00:13:04.054
gerut, ho'mir fun dem nisht gelitn, vos iz geven der hunger un der tifus.

00:13:04.054 --> 00:13:08.788
ober keyn bombardirung ho'mir di anderthalbn yor nisht gelitn.

00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:12.388
nor vos den, nor ven zey hobn zikh umgekert, zey hobn tsurik gegilt dem front

00:13:12.546 --> 00:13:15.875
demolts iz frish gevorn di zelbe SIPUR, flegn mir

00:13:15.875 --> 00:13:19.594
blaybn TAKUA tsvishn tsvishn di tsvey,

00:13:19.785 --> 00:13:22.394
di rusishn un daytshn.

00:13:19.887 --> 00:13:22.446
BEIN, yo, un laydn,

00:13:22.705 --> 00:13:30.405
lemayse hobn zey undz nisht gemeynt azoy dos kleyne derfl, di kleyne, zondern lebn undz iz geven a groyse shtot Zhmering hot dos geheysn, dortn geven a groyse

00:13:30.405 --> 00:13:37.121
militer-RIKUZ, mit a sakh vegn iber gants Rusland. fun dortn, s'geven a knoytn-punkt hot dos geheysn.

00:13:37.121 --> 00:13:40.451
fun dort hot men geshikt ale CHAYALIM un ale,

00:13:41.335 --> 00:13:47.381
zey hobn gezukht Zhmerinken, nor oyf tsu kumen tsu Zhmerinko ven zey hobn zikh aropgelozt hobn shoyn ongehoybn fun undz,

00:13:47.381 --> 00:13:48.706
du farshteyst, azoy tsu geyn,

00:13:48.706 --> 00:13:52.233
nor ven der AVIRON, der shtarker rus- daytsher AVIRON

00:13:52.233 --> 00:13:57.050
iz derkh undzer MIKNA, ho'mir gemuzt ale hobn mir gemuzt aroysloyfn, di hayzer zenen geven ARUA fun di

00:13:57.050 --> 00:14:01.376
fun di frierike, iz es geven di ershte sakone fun fun dem HEDEF,

00:14:01.804 --> 00:14:06.298
zol undz nisht aynshitn. dos ershte vos m'hot getun ho'mir gemuzt aroysloyfn.

00:14:06.298 --> 00:14:09.934
lebn undz iz geven a kleyn veldl, hot men genumen loyfn ahin. vos ⟨dosh⟩ optsutun veys ikh nisht.

00:14:09.934 --> 00:14:12.007
nor koydem hot men gemuzt aroysloyfn fun der shtub.

00:14:12.132 --> 00:14:15.348
az afile, s'flegn s'flegt faln bomben bay undz oykh.

00:14:15.388 --> 00:14:20.967
nor dos rov fleg men dort bashisn, un vos m'hot dort bashosn flegt bay undz tsitern dos,

00:14:20.974 --> 00:14:23.668
fleg'mir muzn aroysloyfn. un demolts iz di panik geven shreklekh.

00:14:23.725 --> 00:14:25.389
aroysgelofn, un bay nakht,

00:14:25.463 --> 00:14:33.256
kinder, mit froyen, mit veynendike kinder, mit mit m'iz gelofn eyner oyfn andern, di behole iz geven, dos ken men nisht bashraybn.

00:14:33.256 --> 00:14:34.333
dos iz shreklekh.

00:14:35.115 --> 00:14:42.208
un nokh hot zikh UNK, ven der front iz vayter gegangen tsu Rumenye ho'mir frish gehat a bisl ru.

00:14:42.208 --> 00:14:45.127
ober s'iz geven gefalene fun undzer oykh.

00:14:45.127 --> 00:14:48.964
ven ir zogt dos, afile in lager hot men gelernt. iz geven a khazn,

00:14:49.003 --> 00:14:50.991
iz far a a shtikl broyt

00:14:50.991 --> 00:14:55.826
fleg er zitsn mit di kinder. un undzer lernen mit di kinder, zenen geven nayn, tsen-yerike kinder demolts,

00:14:55.826 --> 00:14:58.509
hot di mame gegebn avekgegebn a shtikl broyt

00:14:58.509 --> 00:15:02.449
der tate olev-asholem fleg nisht gegesn gekoyft bay goyish, un undz ho'mir yo gegesn, s'geven biliker,

00:15:02.449 --> 00:15:05.129
fleg di mame a mol koyfn a bisl mel, m'fleg es aleyn bakn.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:10.026
iz der melamed vos hot gelernt mit mayne di yingelekh, mit di tsvey briderlekh mayne,

00:15:10.026 --> 00:15:11.981
az far broyt hot er gelernt.

00:15:12.088 --> 00:15:18.562
un aza melamed iz geven bayn a bay bayn a HAFTSATSA, bayn an anderer mishpokhe gelernt mit a yingele fun fir finef yor,

00:15:19.193 --> 00:15:22.286
er iz gezesn baym tish azoy vi do mitn kind un gelernt,

00:15:22.286 --> 00:15:24.519
a PTSATSA iz gefaln bay der tir.

00:15:24.778 --> 00:15:26.783
UNK der eybershter UNK.

00:15:26.783 --> 00:15:29.902
eyn neyn, dos iz geven a soykher vos iz arayngekumen tsum foter.

00:15:30.178 --> 00:15:35.491
nebekh er iz gefaln, un der melamed mitn kind, un di mame iz geven in shtub, hot zi gornisht gehat ki-hu-ze.

00:15:35.491 --> 00:15:38.492
un do azoy bay der tir iz gefaln epes a PTSATSA nebekh UNK.

00:15:38.515 --> 00:15:41.583
ikh zog aykh s'do tsu dertseyln un tsu dertseyln.

00:15:41.583 --> 00:15:43.970
di lage iz geven azoy groyzam az nor,

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:47.303
un fun dest vegn, ir zet, hot men avekgegebn di shtikl broyt fun dem moyl

00:15:47.303 --> 00:15:48.920
oyf tsu lernen di kinder.

00:15:49.433 --> 00:15:53.156
un di di SIPUR vos ikh hob aykh dertseylt mitn veyts.

00:15:53.196 --> 00:15:55.451
vos dos ze'mir shoyn geven in lager.

00:15:55.845 --> 00:15:57.611
vos s'geven far pe-

00:15:56.588 --> 00:15:59.349
ven zent ir arayn in lager, ven m'hot aykh in,

00:15:58.512 --> 00:16:00.328
yare eyn un fertsik.

00:15:59.946 --> 00:16:02.370
aha in lager. un vos iz gevezn demolts?

00:16:02.322 --> 00:16:05.931
vos iz geven, tsores tsroyres. ershtnser m'iz geven

00:16:06.173 --> 00:16:10.082
koydem vos m'hot undz getribn, biz undz ze'mir gekumen in mokem menukh-

00:16:10.138 --> 00:16:12.579
in dem Zhurin vu undz ze'mir geven dray yor.

00:16:12.889 --> 00:16:19.450
dort in dem derfl ho'mir zikh bahaltn, nisht nor undz, a gantse KVUTSA, azoy vi ikh dertseyl aykh, m'hot zikh ongetun di kufalkes mit di dos.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:23.120
undz UNK undz zo'mir nisht zayn oyffalnd, m'zol undz nisht nemen, m'fleg alts khapn

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:28.593
un avekshikn. dos hot ge- dos di dos dos deys peltsl heyst kufalke oyf rusish.

00:16:23.284 --> 00:16:26.146
kufalkes? m'hot ongetun zikh kufalkes?

00:16:28.684 --> 00:16:35.743
un deys di di KOVA di ho'mir gemuzt trogn far kelt. oykh khuts mize undz zo'mir oyszen mer rusishe bafelkerung.

00:16:35.743 --> 00:16:37.689
m'zol nisht zen az undz ze'mir yidn.

00:16:37.932 --> 00:16:43.123
dos undz zol'mir nisht zayn azoy BOLET. khuts mize ho'mir farkoyft di gute zakhn undz zo'mir hobn vos tsu esn. dos iz geven,

00:16:43.298 --> 00:16:46.433
ot vegn dem ze'mir geblibn lebn, undz ho'mir gehat,

00:16:45.205 --> 00:16:47.342
velkhe gute zakhn? enk zenen ge-

00:16:46.433 --> 00:16:48.197
di gute kleydung.

00:16:48.158 --> 00:16:49.687
ets zenen antloyfn mit,

00:16:49.648 --> 00:16:51.850
ho'mir zikh ongetun dos beste.

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:58.381
un vel ikh nokh dertseyln a fal. bayn undz ven a meydl azoy vi m'zogt, zi vert geboyrn s'ge- hot men geflantst a tenenboym, UNK azoy vi s'shteyt in a,

00:16:58.381 --> 00:17:04.402
hot men bay undz azoy a meydele iz geboyrn hot men ongehoybn tsu neyen shtofir hot es geheysn. shtofir heyst

00:17:04.425 --> 00:17:09.245
vi azoy zol ikh zogn shtofir, oysshtatung. yo.

00:17:07.867 --> 00:17:09.228
oysshtatung.

00:17:09.353 --> 00:17:12.756
dos hot men aleyn geshtikt, un afile UNK, NEDUNYA.

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:12.418
NEDUNYA in ivrit.

00:17:12.846 --> 00:17:17.424
iz geven met- der tate flegt koyfn gantse roln layvnt un s'fleg kumen a shnayderin un tsushnaydn.

00:17:17.424 --> 00:17:20.183
un di do fornt flegn mir aleyn shtikn, iz demolts geven.

00:17:20.183 --> 00:17:24.309
iz geven bay undz in shtub a sakh layvnt, un a sakh gute zakhn nisht genutste.

00:17:24.309 --> 00:17:28.899
tsum bayshpil, tsikhn, betgevant, gehat oysgeshtikte di zelbe UNK.

00:17:28.899 --> 00:17:34.038
dos ales iz geven, dos ershte far mir, ikh bin geven di eltste. zest Feygele, dos iz dayn nadn.

00:17:34.038 --> 00:17:36.786
fleg men haltn azoy sheyn mit a mash tsugebundn.

00:17:37.062 --> 00:17:40.451
dos ho'mir zikh, fun di zakhn vos ho'mir mitgenumen, un far aza tsikh

00:17:40.451 --> 00:17:43.401
mit aza set layvnt hot men gekent vokhn lebn.

00:17:43.407 --> 00:17:47.080
di goyim hobn nisht gezen keyn layvnt nor ir veyst di proste,

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:50.454
fleg mir alts farkoyfn al- dos ho'mir mitgeshlept mit zikh.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.519
un di gute hemder zikh ongeton, finef zeks gute hemder.

00:17:53.519 --> 00:17:56.363
un di gute mentlen, di shabesdike UNK.

00:17:56.363 --> 00:17:58.886
un dos fleg'mir langzam langzam farkoyfn.

00:17:58.886 --> 00:18:00.985
un fun dem ho'mir ibergelebt dos ershte yor.

00:18:01.378 --> 00:18:05.928
dos tsveyte yor ho'mir gelebt fun, o vi ir zogt fun hant-arbayt in di,

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:12.538
di MEMSHALA, zenen geven shtarke keltn, un di ru- di rumenishe soldatn, nisht di daytshe zenen gevoynt geven mit azolkhe keltn.

00:18:12.538 --> 00:18:15.719
hot men gegebn MAS oyf di ukrainishe bafelkerung

00:18:15.719 --> 00:18:17.876
az yede mishpokhe muz gebn

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:20.781
a por hantshu hantshu,

00:18:19.941 --> 00:18:20.964
KFAFOT.

00:18:20.781 --> 00:18:23.642
KFAFOT, un a por vareme zokn far CHAYALIM.

00:18:23.642 --> 00:18:27.444
dos hot men gemuzt untershraybn az m'git frayvilik, nisht zey hobn nisht geheysn UNK.

00:18:27.518 --> 00:18:33.885
zey hobn nisht shtrikn, zey hobn nisht gevust. vol hobn zey gehat, ir veyst zey flegn aleyn shpiln poshete eynfakhe vol.

00:18:33.087 --> 00:18:33.925
yo.

00:18:33.885 --> 00:18:39.420
un zey hobn afile nisht gevust, un ho'mir shoyn gekent shtrikn a zok mit hantshu fun fun kleynvayz on.

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:44.724
mumkhim ze'mir geven. dos iz geven alts vayl m'hot gelernt di yidishe tokhter arbet in der heym.

00:18:44.815 --> 00:18:49.992
ir hert, un fun dem ho'mir undz oyf vinter gelebt. zey flegn undz brengen di goyishe vol,

00:18:49.992 --> 00:18:56.447
m'hot ge- der tate olev-asholem fleg makhn fun holts shpitslekh, MAS- MASREG- yo,

00:18:54.096 --> 00:18:55.963
MASUGOT, shpin.

00:18:56.447 --> 00:18:58.360
neyn MASREGOT.

00:18:58.568 --> 00:19:02.122
un undz ho'mir geshtrikt far di goyim hantshu un zokn.

00:19:02.196 --> 00:19:06.645
⟨mame iz oykh⟩ geven UNK vi azoy m'hot gemakht a UNK, dos iz a gantse kunts a UNK.

00:19:07.107 --> 00:19:12.399
un keyn gelt hot men nisht genumen derfar, nor produktn. dos heyst kartofl, mel.

00:19:12.675 --> 00:19:15.251
un dos iz mamesh vert, dos iz geven mer vi gold.

00:19:15.578 --> 00:19:21.326
un fun dem ho'mir undz gelebt kimat a vinter. fleg'mir zitsn tog un nakht un arbetn,

00:19:22.041 --> 00:19:27.452
un s'iz iz zeyer shver geven, vayl s'geven shtark shvere, s'nisht di fayne vol vos m'koyft yetst do.

00:19:27.576 --> 00:19:32.480
khuts mize ho'mir gehat ge- sheyn geshtrikte sveters. undzer hant-arbayt UNK.

00:19:32.622 --> 00:19:35.985
un az di goyte hot dos derzen iz zi oysgegangen.

00:19:35.985 --> 00:19:40.744
ikh fleg oystun dem sveter un farkoyfn far a zekl mel un far a dos.

00:19:40.744 --> 00:19:43.517
un undz ho'mir zikh ongeton vi goyishe poshete,

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:45.828
s'zol s'zol nisht zayn kalt.

00:19:46.071 --> 00:19:52.927
vayl undz ho'mir gemuzt hobn, dos ershte iz geven dos dos di dos UNK. dernokh hot zikh ongehoybn ven s'geven shtil, ven der front iz geven vayt,

00:19:52.927 --> 00:19:57.776
iz geven felder arum um in af- af- arum dem derfl.

00:19:57.917 --> 00:20:05.842
dos iz geven zi hot gehert a mol tsum rusishn kolhoz. dernokh hot es ibergenumen di rumener un di tvue hot men geshikt farn far di soldatn farn front esn.

00:20:05.882 --> 00:20:07.580
un m'hot getsvungen di goyim

00:20:07.688 --> 00:20:16.018
di UNK zoln dos baarbetn. zey hobn gehat sheyne mashinen, kombaynes mit dos. flegn zey arbetn tog, far nakht flegn zey avekgeyn,

00:20:16.024 --> 00:20:20.726
un oyfn feld iz geblibn zangen, ir farshteyt

00:20:20.833 --> 00:20:22.666
ikh farshtey UNK.

00:20:20.985 --> 00:20:25.316
SHIBOLIM mit fun veyts un fun fun gershtn, fun vos s'iz geven.

00:20:25.373 --> 00:20:30.345
dos iz geven azoy arum undzer arum undzer di arum undzer derfl.

00:20:30.537 --> 00:20:33.754
azoy zey zenen avek funem ⟨mashin nemen⟩ paze, flegn mir aroysgeyn

00:20:33.861 --> 00:20:40.993
meydlekh aleyn hot men nisht gevolt lozn geyn, fleg di rebetsn, di rebetsn, di mame ole-hasholem mit undz zi vil oykh kloybn, m'hot nisht UNK,

00:20:41.016 --> 00:20:43.392
mir geyen tsuzamen grupenvayz nokh.

00:20:43.392 --> 00:20:46.117
un kloybn, zeklekh, kloybn di di zangen.

00:20:46.117 --> 00:20:50.167
gegangen kumen eyn mol oyf der nakht un m'hot es opge- UNK,

00:20:50.167 --> 00:20:55.269
tseklopt un m'hot gemakht derfun UNK, dos vos ikh hob aykh dertseylt az di rebetsn un, yo.

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.421
dertseylt vider, UNK.

00:20:55.292 --> 00:20:59.015
az zi hot di zangen fun di zangen in a sheynem tog

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:01.901
hot zi geklibn in a zekele,

00:21:00.557 --> 00:21:01.985
ver iz dos gevezn?

00:21:02.245 --> 00:21:06.174
in in ikh veys in tsveytn z- tsveytn zumer geven.

00:21:06.092 --> 00:21:08.803
mit vifl, neyn ver hot dos ver hot dos UNK,

00:21:06.174 --> 00:21:11.852
ye ts- di rebetsn, di Nadverner rebetsn, vos ikh hob aykh dertseylt vos zi iz geven mit undz in lager.

00:21:11.852 --> 00:21:18.674
di itstike alte rebetsn zi zol mayrekh-yomim-veshonim zayn. zi iz di mame fun dem Nadverner rebe in Bney Brak.

00:21:18.833 --> 00:21:20.025
Reb Berele.

00:21:19.862 --> 00:21:20.818
yo.

00:21:20.352 --> 00:21:24.902
kindvayz fleg ikh im zogn Berele, nor, yetst iz er a rebe.

00:21:25.465 --> 00:21:32.464
iz zi hot ge- gezamlt di zangen, in a oysgekokht zekl,

00:21:32.464 --> 00:21:37.136
vi azoy m'hot gekokht dos zekl iz a ekstere zakh, m'fleg leygn tsvey tsigl un a blekhenem top in,

00:21:37.142 --> 00:21:41.406
azoy untergeleygt farshidene grozn trukene un azoy hot men,

00:21:41.817 --> 00:21:47.008
dos iz un dos oyf der nakht hot men zeyer zoyber opgeputst un m'hot es oyfgehongen im mitn

00:21:47.115 --> 00:21:50.231
in mitn plafond un dos hot gehongen a gantsn vinter

00:21:50.254 --> 00:21:53.521
az oyf erev peysekh zol der rebe hobn a por matses.

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:55.277
gekumen ereb peysekh,

00:21:56.110 --> 00:21:59.397
yo iz undz ze'mir aheymgekumen m'hot teykef

00:21:59.397 --> 00:22:05.081
tseklopt di zangen, m'hot gemakht a DAYSA, m'hot koym gevart zol zikh opkokhn un s'zol zayn vos tsu esn nakhtmol.

00:22:05.323 --> 00:22:06.768
erev peysekh

00:22:06.927 --> 00:22:13.333
hot ⟨oykh frish⟩ der tate farkoyft er hot gehat epes a peltsl zeyer a sheyns un m'hot gekoyft a a halb zekl veyts.

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:19.036
gekoyft veyts bayn a goy, un dos hot men gemuzt ober kloybn s'zol zayn oyf peysekh UNK.

00:22:19.043 --> 00:22:21.737
hot men gehat eyn tish azolkhe UNK,

00:22:22.435 --> 00:22:26.259
hot men dos azoy ze'mir geven, der tate olev-asholem hot undz gevizn velekh

00:22:26.383 --> 00:22:32.671
veyts iz trikn aher ahin, un dos rest hot men opgekokht. un dem hot men oysgeklibn az der vet zayn oyf matses oyf peysekh.

00:22:32.931 --> 00:22:37.729
un demolts hob ikh aykh dertseyln in tsveytn peysekh iz geven ven di rusn zenen shoyn ongehoybn tsuriktsukumen,

00:22:37.729 --> 00:22:41.331
un m'hot ongehoybn tsu bombardirn. zenen mir gezesn a tog, undz ho'mir geklibn veyts,

00:22:41.331 --> 00:22:46.036
mir ho'mir gehert di AVIRONIM kl- kumen ze'mir aroysgelofn, m'hot gelozt ales azoy oyfn tish.

00:22:46.768 --> 00:22:55.469
ze'mir tsurikgekumen, s'ales geshtanen. der HEDEF hot gornisht gut getun. ir hert, vi azoy s'geven bintelekh geklibene, in mitn iz geven der gantser hoyfn, azoy ho'mir undz es ge-

00:22:55.560 --> 00:22:58.017
ir veyst shtelt zikh for, dos vos ikh kler tsurik,

00:22:58.075 --> 00:23:03.316
mir ho'mir azoy zelbst farshtendlekh getun. oybn hot geshvebt der toyt, bombardirungen,

00:23:03.424 --> 00:23:07.063
s'shtil gevorn, gekumen tsurik, gegangen m'hot geklibn veyts oyf peysekh.

00:23:08.757 --> 00:23:12.575
demolts ho'mir es nisht gefilt. undz ho'mir, s'nisht geven z-, az ikh kler haynt tsurik,

00:23:12.575 --> 00:23:15.736
mit aza min zelbst-farshtendlekhkeyt, mit aza min,

00:23:15.793 --> 00:23:20.361
shoyn, nokh s'gekumen dos moln dem veyts. ho'mir ge- opgedungen bayn a goyte

00:23:20.361 --> 00:23:24.793
tsvey mil-shteyner. dos zenen geven in gants HAKOL azoy groys, un dos hot es gehat a lokh mit aza

00:23:24.923 --> 00:23:30.184
shtekn, un m'hot alts arayngeleygt a bisl veyts. arings arum hot men untergeleygt aza tsikhl,

00:23:30.184 --> 00:23:31.801
un dos mel fleg araynfaln.

00:23:31.858 --> 00:23:33.796
ho'mir ⟨zoyber⟩ gemakht undzer shtub,

00:23:33.796 --> 00:23:39.969
undz ho'mir farshtupt in a vinkl, un der rebe, der Nadverner rebe, zol zayn a guter meylets far undz, mit nokh etlekhe yunge layt mit der tate.

00:23:40.296 --> 00:23:46.486
hot koydem der rebe gemoln zayn veyts, vayl zayne iz dokh geven opgehit fun mamesh shmire mishays ketsire.

00:23:46.486 --> 00:23:49.414
nor s'geven zeyer shver, m'hot zikh alts gemuzt vayl,

00:23:49.414 --> 00:23:53.886
nor az der rebe hot gedreyt di shteyner, fleg ikh shrayen leshem matses mitsve, ir hert,

00:23:53.886 --> 00:23:59.910
ir v- ir kent dem nusekh fun Nadvernerers davenen? zey davenen azoy di kol azoy vi di karliner.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:05.046
ver s'hot nisht gezen di ayngehoykerte biktaves, zey hobn zikh gemuzt azoy aynbeygn arayntsukumen tsun undz,

00:24:05.085 --> 00:24:11.339
un di sheyn opgekalkhte vent. undz flegn zey haltn zeyer reyn, undz hobn gekoyft kalekh, flegn mir alts kalkhn di budke az s'zol zayn zoyber.

00:24:11.346 --> 00:24:12.656
ze'mir shoyn geven UNK.

00:24:11.633 --> 00:24:14.329
a gants yor oder nor far peysekh oyf peysekh?

00:24:13.489 --> 00:24:17.347
neyn, a gants yor, vayl der kalekh hot geshitst far mikrobn.

00:24:14.329 --> 00:24:18.309
a gants yor. aha.

00:24:18.062 --> 00:24:23.169
khuts mize s'zol reyn. ⟨s'zenen di plotses flegn kumen⟩ arayngekumen flegn makhn blote di vent. dos iz a zakh far zikh.

00:24:24.087 --> 00:24:27.290
ver s'hot nisht gezen di dos bild, in aza min

00:24:27.290 --> 00:24:30.325
farshtupt ort, in aza farshtupte bikta,

00:24:30.398 --> 00:24:35.499
shteyt a rebe un molt dem veyts mit ale koyles un shrayt mit a koyles leshem matses mitsve.

00:24:35.499 --> 00:24:36.956
dos iz geven. yetst di

00:24:37.030 --> 00:24:43.132
un un shoyn azoy s'flegt alts zayn di bombardirung, dernokh hot zikh der front avek geshtupt un s'gevezn a bisl shtil un di rusn zenen arayn.

00:24:43.459 --> 00:24:48.296
di rusn zenen arayn, dos megt ir oykh hern. s'iz an interesante zakh, ikh veys nisht tsi ikh hob es shoyn dertseylt.

00:24:48.859 --> 00:24:59.436
ho'mir ge- iz in a shul, al pi rov hot men aynkvatirt di ale bezhnitses hobn zey geheysn, di ale flikhtlungen, in MOSDOT, shuln groyse.

00:24:59.436 --> 00:25:03.891
iz geven a groyse shul, geboyt take azoy vi a shul, a groyse PROZDOR mit groyse klasn.

00:25:03.891 --> 00:25:08.574
baym sof iz geven UNK vi epes a kekh. ken zayn s'geven a mol a kekh fun der shul.

00:25:08.574 --> 00:25:13.811
iker di mentshn vos hobn gevoynt in der der kekh hobn maskem geven un m'hot gekashert dem oyvn.

00:25:13.885 --> 00:25:19.042
un dortn hobn di ale yidn vos hobn gehat biselekh veyts gemolene, m'hot es tsunoyfgenumen a tog,

00:25:19.116 --> 00:25:20.662
mir bakn matses.

00:25:21.647 --> 00:25:25.196
s'geven shtil, m'hot gevust di rusn zenen shoyn do, ober s'hot undz nisht derkutshet.

00:25:25.196 --> 00:25:30.520
plutsem funem ek PROZDOR, un ikh hob dos ⟨gez- -hert⟩, kumt arayn a a

00:25:30.520 --> 00:25:38.718
o- a rusisher natshalnik flegn zey, natshalnik heyst a greserer ofitsir, nor a greserer mit DARGOT, KATZIN.

00:25:40.412 --> 00:25:46.990
un kukt azoy rekhts links. vos hot men gezen? mentshn krank oyf der erd. iz geven etlekhe UNK. un der UNK

00:25:46.990 --> 00:25:49.603
un er shpant glaykh tsum sof,

00:25:50.520 --> 00:25:52.550
er hot derfilt dem gerukh fun di matses.

00:25:52.550 --> 00:25:53.942
do hot men gevust azoy.

00:25:53.942 --> 00:26:02.816
do ze'mir poter gevorn funem daytsh ze'mir fizish geratevet gevorn, nor ⟨hitst vayzt⟩ undz a shvere MAARACHA, a gaystishe UNK, vi loyt vi di rusishe yidn hobn undz dertseylt

00:26:02.890 --> 00:26:07.389
az vi azoy m'tor nisht haltn yidishkeyt, dos zey flegn groyzame zakhn dertseylt az zey hobn gezen

00:26:07.463 --> 00:26:13.785
a kind geyn in shul oder vos hot di gantse mishpokhe fleg men shikn far Sibir. ho'mir shtark moyre gehat far yidishkeyt.

00:26:13.825 --> 00:26:17.886
un do hot men zey gekhapt AL CHAM, der rus hobn gekha- matses bakn.

00:26:17.925 --> 00:26:21.395
ir hert, der iz geshtanen a por minut ongeshpart on der tir,

00:26:21.418 --> 00:26:24.596
un kukt azoy un nokh git a derfreg a reyn yidish,

00:26:24.596 --> 00:26:27.234
s'iz m- shmire mishays ketsire?

00:26:27.679 --> 00:26:32.111
ven ir zet di yidn vi azoy m'hot ongehoybn tsu tantsn, UNK a yid!

00:26:32.961 --> 00:26:38.745
un nokh hob ikh es dertseylt far mamen, er iz shoyn nisht geven keyn yunger mentshn der vos der ofits- der ofitsir.

00:26:38.745 --> 00:26:43.352
iz varshaynlekh, hot mame oysgerekhnt, az er, ven di rusn zenen gekumen tsum makht hot gedarft zayn

00:26:43.352 --> 00:26:46.927
a mentsh fun tsvontsik yor. dos heyst er iz gevaksn in a yidisher shtub.

00:26:49.009 --> 00:26:50.049
ir kent redn.

00:26:50.038 --> 00:26:51.567
neyn, er hot epes gema-

00:26:50.460 --> 00:26:51.534
neyn neyn.

00:26:51.591 --> 00:26:53.812
er hot gevaksn in a yidishe shtub,

00:26:54.156 --> 00:27:02.807
oder iz er geven a aleyn a yeshive bokher oder mit a ⟨zeyde⟩, er hot gevust fun, vayl afile di yidn vos zenen geven hobn shoyn nisht gevust fun shmire mishays ketsire, oyb er hot gevust fun matses.

00:27:02.813 --> 00:27:05.574
ot der iz nokh geven a mentsh vos hot gelebt farn

00:27:05.715 --> 00:27:08.623
far di befor di rusn zenen gekumen tsum makht.

00:27:08.623 --> 00:27:10.434
hot er nokh gevust fun aza zakh.

00:27:10.626 --> 00:27:15.643
az fun ales vos er hot dertseylt, in Stalingrad hot der rus gekhapt dem ershtn klop un fun dortn hot men im avekge-

00:27:15.643 --> 00:27:17.592
zogt er, er kumt fun Stalingrad, zogt er,

00:27:17.592 --> 00:27:20.756
vu er kumt in a shtetl, vu er ⟨ober⟩ tsurik vu,

00:27:20.756 --> 00:27:22.992
dos ershte, zogt er, zukh a yid.

00:27:22.992 --> 00:27:25.250
ir zent di ershte yidn vos ikh hob bagegnt.

00:27:25.645 --> 00:27:29.810
ir hert, ven er iz aroys hob ikh im gezen, undz ho'mir zikh bahaltn, far vos ho'mir zikh undz bahaltn?

00:27:29.837 --> 00:27:31.594
demolts bin ikh shoyn geven in akhtsn yor,

00:27:31.594 --> 00:27:33.324
shoyn geven a andere bitere sakone.

00:27:33.324 --> 00:27:36.040
di rusn hobn genumen meydlekh in militer, in Rus-

00:27:35.179 --> 00:27:36.037
eyn minut.

00:27:36.040 --> 00:27:36.492
yo.
